# func/text/tx_code (id 313): CODE / UNICODE core. A = text or error. Result A = (1, first UTF-16 unit),
# #VALUE! (4, 3) for "", or the error unchanged.
# PC 0: error -> return; else read [h] (length), PC 1. PC 1: length 0 -> A = #VALUE!, return; else read
# [h + 2] (first packed word), PC 2. PC 2: A = (1, word mod 2^16), return (LR, LP).
# Note: weights/func/text/tx_code.md
